      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "City Properties are delighted to present this fantastic own door 2-bedroom 2 bathroom duplex apartment to the market. No. 7 comes to the market in good condition and is situated in the modern, sought after development that is Slade Castle Heights in the heart of Saggart Village. The area has a wealth of local amenities including shopping facilities, restaurants, schools/crèches and has superb transport links nearby such as the M7 Motorway, the M50 bus services and the Red Luas Line. This ideal starter home is presented with spacious living accommodation of 81 sq. meters, comprising of a large dual aspect bright open plan living/dining room with large windows making it very bright and perfect for entertaining guests or relaxing with family. The open kitchen is just off the living / dining area and is equipped with built-in units, ample storage space, a bright window making it very social for cooking and moving around. The property offers two generously sized bedrooms, main en-suite, both featuring built-in wardrobes, Storage rooms, and main bathroom. NO ONWARD CHAIN - Register your interest by EMAIL early to avoid disappointment.\r\n\r\nSlade Castle is an established development, in the picturesque village of Saggart, at the foothills of the Dublin mountains, with its many shops, cafes, restaurants and schools, nearby leisure facilities, Citywest business campus, etc., The communal gardens are well-maintained and provide a tranquil space to relax or enjoy outdoor activities. Additionally, there is a children's creche and play area within the complex, ensuring that families are well-catered for. Buses to the city centre and beyond are also on your doorstep as is the Luas red line. Easy access to the Naas Road, the M50 & N7 etc.,. Viewing of this property is highly recommended and through sole selling agents City Properties."
      },
